  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 819 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Bacteriostatic water is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; FDA's history shows an earlier shortage first posted on 2021-12-03, since resolved.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1106244 at Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited ended 2019-09-06 and was classified OAI, with the classification letter dated 2020-05-25 — 819 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2021-12-03.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1110899 at Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343) ended 2019-11-21 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2020-02-12 — 743 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1115467 at Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) ended 2020-01-17 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2020-04-15 — 686 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued 2020-03-25 (case 594972) to Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited — 618 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E35"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's OAI classification letter to Hospira, Inc. is dated 2020-04-22, 590 days before the shortage posting, and to Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited is dated 2020-05-25, 557 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D8", "D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Fujian Genohope Biotech Ltd., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    }
  ]
}
